@.str.66 = private unnamed_addr constant [260 x i8] c"\0A          If set to `true`, changes to the Nix store metadata (in\0A          `/nix/var/nix/db`) are synchronously flushed to disk. This improves\0A          robustness in case of system crashes, but reduces performance. The\0A          default is `true`.\0A        \00", align 1
